#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:661
msgid ""
"Bed temperature for layers after the first one. Set this to zero to keep the "
"first layer bed temperature for the entire print."
msgstr ""
"Temperatura de la base per a les capes posteriors a la primera. Establiu-ho "
"a zero per mantenir la temperatura de la base de la primera capa durant tota "
"la impressió."

