#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:774
msgid "Enable manual fan speeds"
msgstr "Activa les velocitats manuals del ventilador"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:775
msgid ""
"When enabled, use the manual fan speed values below for each feature type. "
"This disables dynamic overhang fan speeds to prevent conflicting fan "
"commands. Useful for fine-tuned control over fan behavior per feature."
msgstr ""
"Quan està activat, utilitza els valors manuals de velocitat del ventilador "
"de sota per a cada tipus d'element. Això desactiva les velocitats dinàmiques "
"del ventilador per a voladissos per evitar ordres de ventilador "
"conflictives. Útil per a un control acurat del comportament del ventilador "
"per element."

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:782
#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:1544
msgid "Overhang perimeters"
msgstr "Perímetres de voladís"

#: src/luminary/config/catalog/PrintConfig.cpp:783
msgid ""
"Fan speed for overhang perimeters. Used in both auto cooling and manual fan "
